#: src/views/swap_view.rs:104
msgid ""
"Review installer-managed swap partitions and manage the legacy supplementary"
" swap file"
msgstr "檢視由安裝程式管理的交換分割區，並管理傳統的輔助交換檔案"

#: src/views/swap_view.rs:155
msgid "Swap partition"
msgstr "交換分割區"

#: src/views/swap_view.rs:169
msgid "Additional swap file"
msgstr "額外的交換檔案"

#: src/views/swap_view.rs:195
msgid "Additional swap file size"
msgstr "額外交換檔案大小"

#: src/views/swap_view.rs:196
msgid "0 GiB means no supplementary swap file"
msgstr "0 GiB 表示沒有額外的交換檔案"

#: src/views/swap_view.rs:598
msgid ""
"This swap file is the configured resume target. Disabling it will break "
"hibernation. Continue?"
msgstr "此交換檔案是設定的休眠恢復目標。停用此檔案會導致休眠功能失效。是否繼續？"

#: src/views/swap_view.rs:705
msgid ""
"This swap file is the configured resume target. Its physical offset would "
"change, so resize is blocked until hibernation is disabled."
msgstr "此交換檔案是設定的休眠恢復目標。調整大小會改變其實體偏移量，因此停用休眠前無法調整大小。"

#: src/views/swap_view.rs:722
msgid "unknown"
msgstr "未知"

#: src/views/swap_view.rs:738
msgid "No swap partition — a legacy swap file can be managed below"
msgstr "沒有交換分割區 — 可在下方管理傳統交換檔案"

#: src/views/swap_view.rs:207
msgid "Remove incompatible file"
msgstr "移除不相容的交換檔案"

#: src/views/swap_view.rs:377
msgid "Removing incompatible swap file…"
msgstr "正在移除不相容的交換檔案…"

#: src/views/swap_view.rs:790
msgid "Present but inactive"
msgstr "存在但非活動中"

#: src/views/swap_view.rs:792
msgid "Not created — choose a size below to add one"
msgstr "尚未建立 — 請在下方選擇大小以新增一個"

#: src/views/swap_view.rs:794
msgid "Not created — at least 20 GiB must remain free"
msgstr "尚未建立 — 必須保留至少 20 GiB 的可用空間"

#: src/views/swap_view.rs:830
msgid ""
"Resize is locked because this file is the configured hibernation resume "
"target"
msgstr "由於此檔案是設定的休眠恢復目標，因此無法調整大小"

#: src/views/swap_view.rs:832
msgid ""
"Optional compatibility file; 0 GiB removes it and 20 GiB remains reserved "
"for the system"
msgstr "選用的相容性檔案；設為 0 GiB 可將其移除，系統將保留 20 GiB 空間"

#: src/views/swap_view.rs:834
msgid ""
"Disabled on Btrfs because a root-subvolume swap file would prevent Disk "
"Snapshots Manager recovery points"
msgstr "已在 Btrfs 上停用，因為根子卷中的交換檔案會妨礙磁碟快照管理員建立復原點"

#: src/views/zram_view.rs:120
msgid ""
"Create a compressed RAM swap device for faster memory pressure handling."
msgstr "建立壓縮記憶體交換裝置，以更快處理記憶體壓力。"

#: src/views/stress_test_view.rs:171
msgid "Ensure important work is saved before running this test."
msgstr "在執行此測試前，請確保重要工作已儲存。"

#: src/views/swap_view.rs:283
msgid "Max % of RAM the compressed pool may occupy. Recommended: 20%"
msgstr "壓縮空間可佔用 RAM 的最大百分比。建議：20%"

#: src/views/dashboard_view.rs:141
msgid "Real-time RAM, swap, and compression subsystem status"
msgstr "即時 RAM、交換空間及壓縮子系統狀態"

#: src/views/swap_view.rs:308
msgid "Reclaim pool pages under memory pressure. Recommended: ON"
msgstr "在記憶體壓力下回收空間頁面。建議：開啟"

#: src/views/stress_test_view.rs:107
msgid "Simulate memory pressure to test swap and OOM behavior"
msgstr "模擬記憶體壓力以測試虛擬記憶體及記憶體不足行為"

#: src/views/stress_test_view.rs:161
msgid "Warning: This will consume system memory and may cause instability"
msgstr "警告：此操作將耗用系統記憶體，並可能導致系統不穩定"

